{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c4d7a3f4e374d288425965c14620cf4b461335913aff93c8c00dd19a2b8a9c12", "ja": "（依頼していた、このみさんの新曲が届いた！\n早く聴いてもらいたいけど、どこにいるだろう？）", "zh": "（拜托创作的这个美小姐的新歌送来了！\n真想让她赶快听听，可她会在哪里呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "9273bc55d84880e9554cad9f4d47acc56da7203e5213eb839e9e8d36f55007db", "ja": "ええ～！！？", "zh": "诶诶～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "9273bc55d84880e9554cad9f4d47acc56da7203e5213eb839e9e8d36f55007db", "ja": "ええ～！！？", "zh": "诶诶～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5f086782804404fc6633c37ec5218f77d0c2227a2a96444e186cb3acdb5d99e6", "ja": "ん？　今の声は……真と、麗花か？", "zh": "嗯？刚才的声音是……真和丽花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "e18a63cdf89ddbf865e0a6d54152a630e916c689a16ab4c1c63b73c0e4216383", "ja": "あら、そんなに意外だったかしら？　雰囲気は、\nけっこう似てるって言われるんだけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，有那么出乎意料吗？大家都说，我们的气质还挺像的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "1aae102979b83ac7c8a0b45ffd50bab72225afc7a75e913e946c27f36d4336bf", "ja": "遠目だったので、雰囲気まではわからなくて……\nこのみ師匠の妹さんなら、挨拶したかったな～！", "zh": "因为当时离得远，所以没看清她的气质……要是这位木实师父的妹妹，我真想和她打个招呼啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "305a98c4907d927f99c24c3808245941fa17052b065130bbd7003d7f99e2919a", "ja": "妹さん、私も会いたかったな～。でもでも、一緒に\n遊びに行くなんて、仲良し姉妹って感じですね♪", "zh": "我也好想见见妹妹呀～。不过不过，会一起\n出去玩，感觉是一对感情很好的姐妹呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "520ec1e17b7e59db24f17d77745a31327d46eadb28a0002c24e73ab932305d4e", "ja": "私はひとりっこだから、\nきょうだいって、なんだかうらやましいです！", "zh": "因为我是独生女，所以总觉得有兄弟姐妹真让人羡慕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "915a87dd906487fe5125cae5fedee513888c566187fb38f7d1c574433754104a", "ja": "ウフフ、そうね。\n年が近いから、友達みたいな感じよ。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。因为年龄相仿，所以感觉就像朋友一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "54236ce0d3c96b519e3e560ba39892fb580d874f0b573e00f92fce740f3c57d6", "ja": "久しぶりにふたりで出かけたけど、楽しかったわ！\nあの子も、元気になったみたいだし……。", "zh": "好久没两个人一起出门了，真开心呀！\n那孩子好像也打起精神来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "3ab6286c007af8676b317c4e2ed3970fb336c45c9146774a3f7933634b36d7df", "ja": "？　妹さん、元気がなかったんですか？", "zh": "？你妹妹之前没精神吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "ffda0ac123d87d6996c01cf27f81d410032fb5f36eaf85b9773a621136da5b16", "ja": "ええ。卒業後の進路の事で、ちょっと悩んでたみたい。\nそれで、相談を受けてたの。", "zh": "嗯。她好像在为毕业后的出路有些烦恼。\n所以她来找我商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "2a2a40a93bf58faee0adbc68b1cd79d2643d09083c06dbed5fa63ac3c3cc4868", "ja": "わぁ、いいお姉さんって感じですね！\nそれでそれで、どんなアドバイスをしたんですか？", "zh": "哇，很有好姐姐的感觉呢！\n然后呢然后呢，你给了什么样的建议呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "093539efaa128495722ada411d908cdb57e48a82efc52409a098c1557e1a9fd3", "ja": "特別なことは何も言ってないわよ？", "zh": "我什么特别的话都没说哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1014_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2def01e4f312c03c6f38641ebf5885422a49349d1a57a90558300b4f8b6eb62c", "ja": "やっぱり、真と麗花だったか。あ、このみさん、\nここにいたんですね！　よかった、探してたんです。", "zh": "果然是真和丽花啊。啊，木实，\n你原来在这里啊！太好了，我正找你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "080e3e2fdbba5ceac9b5cc0dd5604063b4c7e5030b0d895e1d7e06b223932ec1", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。\nどうしたの、私に何か用？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。\n怎么啦，找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "1e53d7893940f7a6cfd8e20a0a473a8acb8b6d7e6f9a6e45714189a1d286c66b", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n今、このみさんの進路相談を聞いていたんですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我刚才正在听木美姐商量出路呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1018_p", "source_sha256": "90f15a8ab3406062718a9cab1b3b6b24bb7ebf9ef134e688e7bfb1fca2cb3042", "ja": "進路相談……って、このみさんが！？", "zh": "升学咨询……居然是这个美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "e0e345fb67983dc3843f48a646e69b2f6fefbe6b45b5a0f722b6b233b12c7415", "ja": "私じゃないわよ！\n妹がね、卒業後の進路に悩んでて、相談しに来たの。", "zh": "不是我啦！\n是我妹妹，她在为毕业后的出路烦恼，来找我商量的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "b940487abf13365ba0ee3266456715264859d47ec2d664f503c0ef73ca93f983", "ja": "でも本当に、普通のことしか言ってないわよ。\n「自分が後悔しない道を選びなさい」って。", "zh": "但我真的也没说什么特别的。只是告诉她：“选择一条自己不会后悔的路。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "2990e25c4ba4bddd68079b4013cbafef9f553616a3b12668e479777a8a0ca10e", "ja": "おおっ！", "zh": "哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "7913a273914a69f455c1787b81c3e76d31bb6cff86b9f54629f9af151dec1b59", "ja": "おお～♪", "zh": "喔喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1023_p", "source_sha256": "958d9b934785adc05f8a910899deafc716f55d7b1d0db8d55a17646bed62dcc4", "ja": "おお……。", "zh": "喔喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "1e7f7203eb67a05ec82dc610f1d88b44b3c305c6d7a124a6661011c963a39295", "ja": "さすが、人生の先輩のアドバイスはためになるなぁ！\nメモメモ……っと。", "zh": "不愧是人生前辈的建议，真是受益匪浅啊！\n记下来记下来……搞定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "db5c817d167e649c6e582b7b72a7bf95369b643f1e46d852abc193220ba16387", "ja": "もう、メモする程のことじゃないでしょ。\nそれより{$P$}、用事はいいの？", "zh": "真是的，哪至于特意记下来啊。\n比起这个，{$P$}，你的正事办完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1026_p", "source_sha256": "df77d109ff2e9cb5fe56f4f130d9a80f21568168841b08fa92cac3064e2730cd", "ja": "はっ！　そうでした。\nこのみさんがカッコよくて、つい忘れてました。", "zh": "啊！对哦。小此木小姐实在太帅气了，我一不小心就忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "99c4fe653f42263b53a77a068839cb532bdd307c38754eb38c1e8b6016805614", "ja": "それ、褒めてるのよね？", "zh": "那是在夸我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1028_p", "source_sha256": "68f7bd6562180c085e211a13329f30819cc6f95bee240b510852f61a0e4153c1", "ja": "もちろんです！　実は、次の定期公演、\nこのみさんの新曲お披露目をしたいと思ってるんです。", "zh": "当然！其实，我想在下一场定期公演上，首次公开演唱这首歌的确是小此的……嗯，也就是您的新曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "750f3f565b9fe1e8a9c1c3a40c2b02d0fd25e6b014f9a292afe6d8210355a7e0", "ja": "えっ。私の……新曲！？", "zh": "诶，我的……新歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b404b5ebe5c3c01d466699bbb6e74e043bd5197710a7b32bd8e48ffa6ef07c01", "ja": "はい！　さっき、届いたところで……\nまずは、聴いてみてください！", "zh": "是的！刚刚才送到……\n请先听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_1031", "source_sha256": "236630c120adb674a84e76ebdfed641c93c40c5430924cdce21b889c197c9560", "ja": "流す", "zh": "播放", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2001_039kon", "source_sha256": "b48bf40a3e36d9a2d8093ea5d38b458693430d214647f0f754fca0f7eb854f58", "ja": "これが、私の新しい曲……。", "zh": "这就是，我的新歌……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2002_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ae686c8d8c1fbc383fc6d7b9cdfab638340fcaa4e649b006fc47834b32aa0ca", "ja": "わぁ～……とっても、素敵な曲ですね！\nちょっと切ない感じもして……ふんふんふふん♪", "zh": "哇～……真是一首非常美妙的歌呢！\n还带有一点感伤的感觉……哼哼哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "c31a949a7ce90f7aab31e5377bcfd52c1718830daa2b2f2362f7cc29d35c803c", "ja": "この曲を、このみ師匠が……！\nボク、なんだか鳥肌が立ってきました！", "zh": "这首歌居然是由木师父……！\n我不知怎么的，鸡皮疙瘩都起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2004_p", "source_sha256": "8621cd300a8975b19f1e84aebbdfcc4fffd804c0674f0f5fddbd8f42a2614087", "ja": "どうですか？　このみさん。\nいい感じの曲だと思うんですけど。", "zh": "怎么样？木实。\n我觉得这首歌感觉挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2005_039kon", "source_sha256": "875301c622303cda873323bd92e08a5d0d35633ef5ca5d635992a4f22ca71d2d", "ja": "え？　……ええ、そうね。\nとっても、素敵な曲だと思うわ。", "zh": "诶？……嗯，是啊。\n我也觉得是首非常棒的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2006_p", "source_sha256": "98909837d197e0bc766239d56e12f8a66dba4fb03053bafe48b9f7f9c8df4351", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて、安心しました。\nそれじゃ、さっそく公演の準備を……。", "zh": "能听到你这么说，我就放心了。\n那么，马上开始准备公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_072_2007_039kon", "source_sha256": "8e74c1388b544245e93b9c44183f3f454798e89698795b157612884bf8a72798", "ja": "あ……ごめんなさい、{$P$}。\nその話、少しだけ考えさせてくれないかしら？", "zh": "啊……抱歉，{$P$}。\n能不能让我再稍微考虑一下这件事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
